                <mxCell id="xLI8fmPE3UcsLwBJXqCc-13" value="i assume the work load is most of the time variable&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E6E6E6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
