                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="xLI8fmPE3UcsLwBJXqCc-15" value="so the case like input stationary&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;weight stationary is not possible always&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;but as the we have 16by16 MAC&amp;nbsp; which means we need most of the time tiling&amp;nbsp;&lt;div&gt;so i tried MAC to optimize it for &lt;b&gt;output stationary architecture&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E6E6E6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
